          "file": "lesson-23-ence-ance-segment-1-1.mp3",
          "hash": "c33f441ba81ec2840ad63a5dc2ed8a5364658640834b57ad8f5a77634068c7eb"
        }
      ]
    },
    "lesson-23-ence-ance-segment-2": {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "When English ends in the ending spelled E N C E, Spanish often has encia.",
